<title>USA: BBN has no comment on stock trading -- NYSE.</title>
<headline>BBN has no comment on stock trading -- NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Monday that BBN Corp, an Internet access provider, has declined comment on the unusual market activity on the company's stock.</p>
<p>The Big Board said that, in response to an inquiry, the company said it is not its policy to comment on unusual market activity or rumors.</p>
<p>BBN was up 1-3/8 to 21-1/2 in midday trading.</p>
</text>
